      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Ask your hospital or lab for an all-inclusive quote covering both the scan and blood test together, and check whether your health insurance maternity rider covers first trimester screening, since some policies do. If cost is a genuine concern, ask your doctor about government facilities or camps in your area.',
