      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Try standing or walking briefly every half hour to an hour, doing gentle ankle rolls or shoulder stretches at your desk, and using a footrest or cushion to support your posture. A short walk during lunch or between meetings adds up meaningfully over a full workday. None of this needs to be elaborate or visible to colleagues.',
