      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.doctor, '', [
        'Ask your doctor if your specific role involves heavy lifting, prolonged standing, or other physical demands that might need adjusting.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'The best desk-day movement is rarely dramatic; it is simply remembering to change position often, which your body will thank you for by evening.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'Short, frequent breaks beat one long workout for desk-bound days.',
        'Stand or walk briefly every 30 to 60 minutes.',
        'Gentle stretches and a supportive footrest help at your desk.',
        'A short lunchtime walk adds up over the day.',
        'Ask your doctor about adjustments if your role is physically demanding.',
