      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.why, '', [
        'Rising hormones increase blood flow to your gums and can make them more reactive to plaque, which is why bleeding gums are common in pregnancy even with a normal brushing routine. Left unaddressed, gum inflammation can worsen, and some evidence links more severe gum disease to a higher chance of preterm birth, which is exactly why dental care deserves real attention now.',
      ], []),
