        'Brush gently twice a day with a soft-bristled brush, floss daily, and do not skip dental checkups because you are pregnant; routine cleanings and most dental treatments are safe, ideally scheduled for your second trimester when you are most comfortable. Tell your dentist that you are pregnant so they can plan around it appropriately.',
